    "Scan of the 1974 edition of the Harwich, Massachusetts, topographic map at 1:25,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1940; aerial photographs from 1939; field checked in 1974; last revised in 1973; printed in 1988.",
